@startuml 状态变更机制时序图

!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 60

participant "Event" as Event
participant "WorkflowEventBus" as EventBus
participant "WorkflowEventBusFireWorker" as FireWorker
participant "EventHandler" as Handler
participant "StateActionFactory" as Factory
participant "StateAction" as Action
participant "WorkflowInstance/TaskInstance" as Instance
participant "InstanceDao" as Dao
participant "Database" as DB

== 工作流状态变更流程 ==

note over Event, DB: **工作流状态变更：RUNNING_EXECUTION → SUCCESS**

Event -> EventBus: publish(WorkflowSucceedLifecycleEvent)
activate EventBus
EventBus -> EventBus: delayEventQueue.add(event)
deactivate EventBus

FireWorker -> EventBus: poll()
activate EventBus
EventBus --> FireWorker: WorkflowSucceedLifecycleEvent
deactivate EventBus

FireWorker -> Handler: handle(workflowRunnable, event)
activate Handler

Handler -> Factory: getAction(workflowRunnable.getState())
activate Factory
note right of Factory: 当前状态: RUNNING_EXECUTION\n返回: WorkflowRunningStateAction
Factory --> Handler: WorkflowRunningStateAction
deactivate Factory

Handler -> Action: succeedEventAction(workflowRunnable, event)
activate Action

Action -> Action: workflowFinish(workflowRunnable, SUCCESS)
Action -> Instance: setState(SUCCESS)
activate Instance
note right of Instance: **状态变更：内存中更新**
Instance --> Action: 状态已更新
deactivate Instance

Action -> Dao: updateById(workflowInstance)
activate Dao
Dao -> DB: UPDATE t_ds_process_instance\nSET state = SUCCESS\nWHERE id = ?
activate DB
DB --> Dao: 更新成功
deactivate DB
Dao --> Action: 更新成功
deactivate Dao

Action -> Action: log.info("state from RUNNING_EXECUTION to SUCCESS")
Action --> Handler: 状态变更完成
deactivate Action

Handler --> FireWorker: 处理完成
deactivate Handler

== 任务状态变更流程 ==

note over Event, DB: **任务状态变更：SUBMITTED_SUCCESS → DISPATCH → RUNNING_EXECUTION → SUCCESS**

group 阶段1: SUBMITTED_SUCCESS → DISPATCH

    Event -> EventBus: publish(TaskDispatchedLifecycleEvent)
    activate EventBus
    EventBus -> EventBus: delayEventQueue.add(event)
    deactivate EventBus
    
    FireWorker -> EventBus: poll()
    activate EventBus
    EventBus --> FireWorker: TaskDispatchedLifecycleEvent
    deactivate EventBus
    
    FireWorker -> Handler: handle(workflowRunnable, event)
    activate Handler
    
    Handler -> Factory: getTaskStateAction(taskInstance.getState())
    activate Factory
    note right of Factory: 当前状态: SUBMITTED_SUCCESS\n返回: TaskSubmittedStateAction
    Factory --> Handler: TaskSubmittedStateAction
    deactivate Factory
    
    Handler -> Action: dispatchedEventAction(workflowRunnable, taskRunnable, event)
    activate Action
    
    Action -> Instance: setState(DISPATCH)
    activate Instance
    note right of Instance: **状态变更：内存中更新**
    Instance --> Action: 状态已更新
    deactivate Instance
    
    Action -> Instance: setHost(workerHost)
    Action -> Dao: updateById(taskInstance)
    activate Dao
    Dao -> DB: UPDATE t_ds_task_instance\nSET state = DISPATCH, host = ?\nWHERE id = ?
    activate DB
    DB --> Dao: 更新成功
    deactivate DB
    Dao --> Action: 更新成功
    deactivate Dao
    
    Action --> Handler: 状态变更完成
    deactivate Action
    Handler --> FireWorker: 处理完成
    deactivate Handler

end

group 阶段2: DISPATCH → RUNNING_EXECUTION

    note over Event: Worker 开始执行任务后\n通过 RPC 回调 Master
    
    Event -> EventBus: publish(TaskRunningLifecycleEvent)
    activate EventBus
    EventBus -> EventBus: delayEventQueue.add(event)
    deactivate EventBus
    
    FireWorker -> EventBus: poll()
    activate EventBus
    EventBus --> FireWorker: TaskRunningLifecycleEvent
    deactivate EventBus
    
    FireWorker -> Handler: handle(workflowRunnable, event)
    activate Handler
    
    Handler -> Factory: getTaskStateAction(taskInstance.getState())
    activate Factory
    note right of Factory: 当前状态: DISPATCH\n返回: TaskDispatchStateAction
    Factory --> Handler: TaskDispatchStateAction
    deactivate Factory
    
    Handler -> Action: startedEventAction(workflowRunnable, taskRunnable, event)
    activate Action
    
    Action -> Action: persistentTaskInstanceStartedEventToDB(...)
    Action -> Instance: setState(RUNNING_EXECUTION)
    activate Instance
    note right of Instance: **状态变更：内存中更新**
    Instance --> Action: 状态已更新
    deactivate Instance
    
    Action -> Instance: setStartTime(event.getStartTime())
    Action -> Instance: setLogPath(event.getLogPath())
    Action -> Dao: updateById(taskInstance)
    activate Dao
    Dao -> DB: UPDATE t_ds_task_instance\nSET state = RUNNING_EXECUTION,\n    start_time = ?, log_path = ?\nWHERE id = ?
    activate DB
    DB --> Dao: 更新成功
    deactivate DB
    Dao --> Action: 更新成功
    deactivate Dao
    
    Action --> Handler: 状态变更完成
    deactivate Action
    Handler --> FireWorker: 处理完成
    deactivate Handler

end

group 阶段3: RUNNING_EXECUTION → SUCCESS

    note over Event: Worker 任务执行成功后\n通过 RPC 回调 Master
    
    Event -> EventBus: publish(TaskSuccessLifecycleEvent)
    activate EventBus
    EventBus -> EventBus: delayEventQueue.add(event)
    deactivate EventBus
    
    FireWorker -> EventBus: poll()
    activate EventBus
    EventBus --> FireWorker: TaskSuccessLifecycleEvent
    deactivate EventBus
    
    FireWorker -> Handler: handle(workflowRunnable, event)
    activate Handler
    
    Handler -> Factory: getTaskStateAction(taskInstance.getState())
    activate Factory
    note right of Factory: 当前状态: RUNNING_EXECUTION\n返回: TaskRunningStateAction
    Factory --> Handler: TaskRunningStateAction
    deactivate Factory
    
    Handler -> Action: succeedEventAction(workflowRunnable, taskRunnable, event)
    activate Action
    
    Action -> Action: persistentTaskInstanceSuccessEventToDB(...)
    Action -> Instance: setState(SUCCESS)
    activate Instance
    note right of Instance: **状态变更：内存中更新**
    Instance --> Action: 状态已更新
    deactivate Instance
    
    Action -> Instance: setEndTime(event.getEndTime())
    Action -> Instance: setVarPool(event.getVarPool())
    Action -> Dao: updateById(taskInstance)
    activate Dao
    Dao -> DB: UPDATE t_ds_task_instance\nSET state = SUCCESS,\n    end_time = ?, var_pool = ?\nWHERE id = ?
    activate DB
    DB --> Dao: 更新成功
    deactivate DB
    Dao --> Action: 更新成功
    deactivate Dao
    
    Action --> Handler: 状态变更完成
    deactivate Action
    Handler --> FireWorker: 处理完成
    deactivate Handler

end

== 状态变更异常处理 ==

note over Action, DB: **如果数据库更新失败，会回滚内存状态**

Action -> Instance: setState(targetState)
Action -> Dao: updateById(instance)
activate Dao
Dao -> DB: UPDATE ...
activate DB
DB --> Dao: **异常：更新失败**
deactivate DB
Dao --> Action: 抛出异常
deactivate Dao

Action -> Instance: setState(originState)
activate Instance
note right of Instance: **回滚：恢复原始状态**
Instance --> Action: 状态已回滚
deactivate Instance

Action -> Action: throw ex

== 状态验证机制 ==

note over Action: **在状态变更前，会验证当前状态是否匹配**

Action -> Action: throwExceptionIfStateIsNotMatch(taskRunnable)
Action -> Instance: getState()
activate Instance
Instance --> Action: 当前状态: RUNNING_EXECUTION
deactivate Instance

Action -> Action: matchState()
Action -> Action: 期望状态: DISPATCH

alt 状态不匹配
    Action -> Action: throw IllegalStateException\n("state is not match")
else 状态匹配
    Action -> Action: 继续执行状态变更
end

== 总结 ==

note over Event, DB
  **状态变更的关键点：**
  
  1. **事件驱动**：状态变更由事件触发
  2. **StateAction 决定**：StateAction 根据业务逻辑决定何时变更状态
  3. **同步更新**：同时更新内存和数据库
  4. **异常回滚**：数据库更新失败时回滚内存状态
  5. **状态验证**：变更前验证当前状态是否匹配
  
  **状态变更不是自动的，而是由 StateAction 主动设置！**
end note

@enduml
